      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{5a5532d9a17f6a503eb2c988|full_name}: I agree with this.  That's part of the thing here... if you want your own personal avatar, you need to work for it, or pay for it.either way, work is involved.  It's not a push-button get-bacon scenario.\n\nI want to be a giant fox or fire-spewing phoenix... I put in the work!  And the results came out wonderfully!  I know not everyone has the knowledge, but that's part of learning.  It takes time.  If it's what you want to do, then do it!\n\nThe reason I even got as good as I am, was because I wanted my own characters, and VRchat has made a medium I like so much, it drove me to create the avatars I have now.  \n\n@{5a6f872dc62a345bf0d88e1c|full_name} sorry if that isn't what you want to hear, but that's the reality.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
