  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello dear developers of this game. I want to express my deepest respect for such an interesting game. It is quite diverse in all types of activities. I hope that you will continue to please on your masterpieces. But let me express some thought about one thing. In this game it's very hard to get your skin, or save it. Yes there is certainly Unity, but many people can not understand, or it does not work to create data skins. Even already appeared cheat to save skins. But can I just tell you that you could put the function of saving avatars with the consent of the character (you want to save the skin). Because of this inconvenience, it is very much to spoil the impression of the game. I will be happy if you answer my pathetic request, but it's not just pathetic. Many players will be happy with this. Yes, and cheat will be much less, and maybe they will not.",
